# ai-wiki RAG benchmark — one JSON object per line. Lines starting with # are ignored.
# Fields: id, question, lang (en|it), category (factual|definition|procedural|numeric|comparison|yes-no|multi-hop|list|negative),
#   difficulty (easy|medium|hard), source_type (kb folder of the expected doc, 'none' for negatives),
#   expected_source_ids (frontmatter source_id of the doc(s) that answer it), expected_keywords (must appear in the answer),
#   expected_answer (gold answer for the LLM judge), should_abstain (true = KB does not cover it; the system must say so), notes.
# Validate with `npm run eval:validate`, run with `npm run eval` (see README §9).
